    GC_Briefing "{EC738C563D85685F}" {
     m_iOrder 4
     m_sTitle "II. Mission (Must Read):"
     m_sContent "Our Mechanized Company has been tasked with securing the Motor Pool containing some of their motorized equipment before continuing to secure a fortified apartment at Udarnik itself."\
     ""\
     "Once we seize the MotorPool, reinforcements (Respawns) will arrive to help replace losses."\
     ""\
